{"2652870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bulken", "steam_appid": 2652870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BULKEN is a rogue-like top down shooter with elements from ARPGs and survivor games. Each run is a new challenge with different loadouts, procedural levels and enemies with random anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game puts emphasis on survival and keeping the player engaged moment to moment with new twists to the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BULKEN is designed to make the progression felt throughout the run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/extras/746047217c850ac08966577f82b2cfa7.poster.avif?t=1785078879\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/extras/746047217c850ac08966577f82b2cfa7.webm?t=1785078879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/extras/746047217c850ac08966577f82b2cfa7.mp4?t=1785078879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of themed rooms with different functionalities and rewards. Use them as safe areas to plot your next move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated runs with perma-death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emphasizing skill, decision making and survival over itemization and grind. Your gear is mere tools for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character and weapons as you discover blueprints for crafting and levels up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and build around Anomalies that can imbue the enemies with special abilities and resistances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan your environment to identify threats as well as opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights with multiple phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to deal with enemies: Break windows to drag enemies into space, shock them with exploding billboards or blast open a pipe to unleash toxic gas etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal sci-fi action with intense gunfights: rail guns, flame throwers, shotguns etc. including options for close combat builds and 'passive' survivor-style builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that this game is still in Alpha and some assets are placeholder and/or unfinished.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BULKEN is a rogue-like top down shooter with elements from ARPGs and survivor games. Each run is a new challenge with different loadouts, procedural levels and enemies with random anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game puts emphasis on survival and keeping the player engaged moment to moment with new twists to the genre.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BULKEN is designed to make the progression felt throughout the run.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/extras/746047217c850ac08966577f82b2cfa7.poster.avif?t=1785078879\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/extras/746047217c850ac08966577f82b2cfa7.webm?t=1785078879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/extras/746047217c850ac08966577f82b2cfa7.mp4?t=1785078879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of themed rooms with different functionalities and rewards. Use them as safe areas to plot your next move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated runs with perma-death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emphasizing skill, decision making and survival over itemization and grind. Your gear is mere tools for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your character and weapons as you discover blueprints for crafting and levels up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and build around Anomalies that can imbue the enemies with special abilities and resistances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan your environment to identify threats as well as opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss fights with multiple phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to deal with enemies: Break windows to drag enemies into space, shock them with exploding billboards or blast open a pipe to unleash toxic gas etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal sci-fi action with intense gunfights: rail guns, flame throwers, shotguns etc. including options for close combat builds and 'passive' survivor-style builds. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that this game is still in Alpha and some assets are placeholder and/or unfinished.</p>", "short_description": "Escape from a giant derelict spaceship filled with lurking enemies. Each run offers new challenges that stand between you and the Bridge.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/dfe73460967e26d969703eb04e95ebaf13fc403d/header.jpg?t=1785078879", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/931c3e5f203c92206eaf14fe71044c3fcc662a7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785078879", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652870/931c3e5f203c92206eaf14fe71044c3fcc662a7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785078879", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul c